{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Kill and Share It!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single player and co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with your friend in local or online co-op! Work together to cause chaos and stream your wild adventures while triveling the world! It\u2019s more fun when you\u2019re surviving together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Minigames!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/bbc308be3fdf8ef0d2e5502b535f3af1.poster.avif?t=1759086844\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/bbc308be3fdf8ef0d2e5502b535f3af1.webm?t=1759086844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/bbc308be3fdf8ef0d2e5502b535f3af1.mp4?t=1759086844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll visit dozens of location and each one of them has its own minigame:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a casino you can gamble;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a hospital you can\u00a0perform surgery;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a restaurant you can cook.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own unique character!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/5c99a2fa60b21a67c61cd816d3e1532f.poster.avif?t=1759086844\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/5c99a2fa60b21a67c61cd816d3e1532f.webm?t=1759086844